OpenPI pi0.5 for DexBioLab

This repository is derived from OpenPI, originally released under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

DexBioLab-specific modifications include:

- DexBioLab LeRobot data configs.
- DexBioLab rendered-zarr to LeRobot conversion tooling.
- Three-camera policy input/output adapters for local LeRobot datasets.
- pi0.5 action-dimension conversion utilities for DexBioLab action layouts.
- Training, normalization, and tmux launch scripts for DexBioLab configs.
- Documentation and installation workflow for standalone DexBioLab pi0.5
  training and serving.

Generated normalization assets, checkpoints, datasets, logs, and training
outputs are intentionally not included.

Gemma-based model components and checkpoints are subject to the Gemma Terms of
Use. See LICENSE_GEMMA.txt. Users are responsible for obtaining and using
checkpoints under the applicable model license terms.
